 you open your laptop on a Friday night, thinking you’ll prototype a fun idea in an hour. You fire up your editor, and your AI agent is ready to write the code. But before you can actually build anything, you hit the setup wall.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"First, you need a database. So you open a new tab, sign up for a provider, verify your email, click through an onboarding flow, provision a database, and copy the connection string. Then you realize you need an LLM, so you go to \",[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"href\":\"https://openrouter.ai\",\"children\":\"OpenRouter\"}],\" to create an account and generate an API key. Your app needs to scrape websites? Time to go to \",[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"href\":\"https://firecrawl.dev\",\"children\":\"Firecrawl\"}],\", sign up, and copy \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"another\"}],\" API key. And if you hit a rate limit and need paid access, you're pulling out your credit card and entering your details separately on every single site.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"None of these tasks are difficult on their own. But together, they pile up into a wall of friction. After 45 minutes of juggling dashboards, pasting API keys into \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\".env\"}],\" files, and wrangling accounts, you start to wonder if this side project which might not even survive tomorrow is worth the grind. You’re stuck acting as human glue, shuffling secrets between half a dozen SaaS dashboards.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Writing code got fast. Provisioning infrastructure didn’t. Until now.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"This is where AI-assisted development is headed next. The future isn’t just about generating code faster; it’s about removing the drag of setup, provisioning, and service management via ClickOps altogether. To tackle this exact pain point, Stripe recently introduced \",[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"href\":\"https://stripe.dev/blog/production-ready-dev-stack-from-terminal\",\"children\":\"Projects.dev\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"what-is-projectsdev\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"What is Projects.dev?\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#what-is-projectsdev\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to What is Projects.dev?\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeLinecap\":\"square\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":1.4,\"d\":\"m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75\"}]}]}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"href\":\"https://projects.dev\",\"children\":\"Projects.dev\"}],\" is Stripe’s new platform for AI-native development. Think of it as an agent-friendly, simplified version of Terraform with unified billing built in. It offers a CLI and a growing ecosystem of \",[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"href\":\"https://projects.dev/providers/\",\"children\":\"integrations\"}],\" that let you and your AI agents provision third-party services directly from the terminal, without leaving your editor.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The core idea is simple but powerful: instead of asking you to go to a provider’s dashboard, create an account, and copy API keys, Projects.dev lets your AI agent run commands that automatically provision resources on your behalf. The credentials are securely retrieved and injected directly into your local environment, so you can start building immediately.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L65\",\"\\n\",\"$L66\",\"\\n\",\"$L67\",\"\\n\",\"$L68\",\"\\n\",\"$L69\",\"\\n\",\"$L6a\",\"\\n\",\"$L6b\",\"\\n\",\"$L6c\",\"\\n\",\"$L6d\",\"\\n\",\"$L6e\",\"\\n\",\"$L6f\",\"\\n\",\"$L70\",\"\\n\",\"$L71\",\"\\n\",\"$L72\",\"\\n\",\"$L73\",\"\\n\",\"$L74\",\"\\n\",\"$L75\",\"\\n\",\"$L76\",\"\\n\",\"$L77\",\"\\n\",\"$L78\",\"\\n\",\"$L79\",\"\\n\",\"$L7a\",\"\\n\",\"$L7b\",\"\\n\",\"$L7c\",\"\\n\",\"$L7d\",\"\\n\",\"$L7e\",\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\",\"\\n\",\"$L8c\",\"\\n\",\"$L8d\",\"\\n\",\"$L8e\",\"\\n\",\"$L8f\",\"\\n\",\"$L90\",\"\\n\",\"$L91\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"65:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"how-does-it-work\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"How does it work?\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#how-does-it-work\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to How does it work?\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$5a:12:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n66:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"To understand how this works, you need to know about \",[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"href\":\"https://agentskills.io/home#what-are-agent-skills\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Agent Skills\"}]}],\". Agent Skills are a standardized, open format that gives AI agents new capabilities. Instead of relying solely on an LLM’s pre-training to guess how to configure a system, you can give your agent a “skill” (essentially a set of instructions and CLI tools) that teaches it how to interact with external platforms securely.\"]}]\n67:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Stripe Projects provides a CLI and an Agent Skill that standardizes how third-party services are provisioned. The catalog includes providers like Neon (for Postgres), Vercel (for hosting), OpenRouter (for AI models), and Firecrawl (for web scraping) etc.\"}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"When you give your AI agent the Stripe Projects skill, it gains the ability to run commands like \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"stripe projects add neon/database\"}],\" to provision a Neon database, without you having to touch a single dashboard. The CLI handles the authentication, provisioning, and secure retrieval of credentials, which are then automatically synced to your local \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\".env\"}],\" file for immediate use in your code.\"]}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The AI handles the heavy lifting; you just guide the architecture.\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"6a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#2D8665] dark:border-green-52 [\u0026_pre]:px-4 [\u0026_pre]:py-3 [\u0026_pre_code]:text-sm! [\u0026_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [\u0026_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[#2D8665] dark:text-green-52\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 16 16\",\"className\":\"shrink-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\"