nefits\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#maintenance-and-long-term-benefits\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Maintenance and long-term benefits\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$5a:12:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n72:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Building an MVP without leaving your editor is an incredible experience, but the real power of this workflow becomes obvious when you look at the long-term lifecycle of your app.\"}]\n73:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"1-seamless-upgrades-with-unified-billing\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"1. Seamless upgrades with unified billing\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#1-seamless-upgrades-with-unified-billing\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to 1. Seamless upgrades with unified billing\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3\",\"children\":\"$5a:12:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Eventually, your weekend project might gain traction. You hit the free-tier limits on Firecrawl, you need a larger compute size in Neon, or you want to use a more expensive AI model on OpenRouter.\"}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Normally, upgrading means logging into three different provider dashboards, entering your credit card details three separate times, and navigating three different billing UIs.\"}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"With \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"projects.dev\"}],\", billing is centralized. Because Stripe already handles your KYC (Know Your Customer) and payment details globally, upgrading is incredibly frictionless. First, configure your billing on Stripe by running:\"]}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Once configured, you just ask your agent to upgrade the resources:\"}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Stripe uses a Shared Payment Token to handle the transaction securely in the background. Your resources are upgraded instantly, and you never have to enter your credit card details on multiple sites again.\"}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"2-painless-credential-rotation\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"2. Painless credential rotation\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#2-painless-credential-rotation\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to 2. Painless credential rotation\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3\",\"children\":\"$5a:12:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"If you accidentally commit your \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\".env\"}],\" file to GitHub or